        },
        {
          "id": "b3a385ad-d7f0-4c55-af3e-85f4b2a669e5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Para obter os dados de uma coleção, basta utilizar o metódo ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "get",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "9f504b31-1cbe-4972-9f36-9c4e67f240a6",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "const { docs } = collection.get();",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c510d77e-ff47-4072-a6de-42dc78195c0c",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Com isso, todos os itens serão obtidos de uma coleção",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c8c8b196-752d-442c-838b-f28e0a807e1f",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "152ebaa5-aed8-4629-ab7f-13e8f398b9fb",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Caso deseja obter apenas um item, é possível definir qual documento você gostaria de obter:",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "9cc31d12-26f2-414e-b0b0-253483aae47e",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "const item = collection.doc('qBzTlbk3waZ3ryIZsaKr').get();\nconst data = item.data();",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "1b4a2f44-afcf-4238-822e-5f4d0646e08c",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "É possível aplicar filtros para obter os documentos do ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Firebase",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "6cac0036-41e7-46dc-ac83-bd7e1026b032",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "const { docs } = collection.where('status', '==', 'pending').get();",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "0fba9a73-405d-4f64-921a-f740a2a724ad",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Um recurso muito interessante do ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Firestore",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " é acompanhar as atualizações em tempo real. É possível acompanhar em múltiplos registros ou até mesmo um único registro. Utiliza-se o metódo ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "onSnapshot",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " para acompanhar as modificações feitas",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "78560655-f65f-4cda-80a3-14012d0ae618",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "useEffect(() => {\n  const subscriber = collection.onSnapshot((snapshot) => {\n    setTasks(snapshot.docs);\n  });\n\n  // Stop listening for updates when no longer required\n  return () => subscriber();\n}, []);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "fde64d1f-081d-4081-adb9-d7ee3a06e0e5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No exemplo, a coleção inteira será observada. Ou seja, a atualização em qualquer documento irá disparar o evento ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "onSnapshot",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "d628dd05-eece-4f56-b284-94793a51ed30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "79d47bcc-9d20-4826-9697-5d4a2d4d44f6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pode-se utilizar para observar apenas registros específicos, usando uma ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "query",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "eeef5a82-563c-41b3-9e82-46ae46f0f249",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "useEffect(() => {\n  const subscriber = collection\n    .where('status', '==', 'pending')\n    .onSnapshot((snapshot) => {\n      setTasks(snapshot.docs);\n    });\n  return () => subscriber();\n}, []);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "4648a18e-9bd0-458f-80de-7f7e4a984f91",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Caso queira acompanhar as atualizações feitas em único objeto, é só informar qual documento gostaria de observar.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "adc30bbe-780b-4daa-9224-08ffc4f5c933",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "useEffect(() => {\n  const subscriber = collection\n    .doc('5wZV4I2TECWo7fnPVXdH')\n    .onSnapshot((snapshot) => {\n      console.log(snapshot.docs);\n    });\n\n  // Stop listening for updates when no longer required\n  return () => subscriber();\n}, []);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
